{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MDY4MzM5","is_bot":false,"login":"aliraza556","name":"Ali Raza"},"body":"## Bounty Claim\n\n**Which bounty are you claiming?**\n\n### Wave 1 — $200 bounties\n- [ ] Google SERP + AI Search Scraper ($200)\n- [ ] Gmail Account Creator + Warmer ($200)\n- [ ] Instagram Account Creator + Warmer ($200)\n\n### Wave 2 — $50 bounties\n- [x] Mobile SERP Tracker ($50)\n- [x] Google Maps Lead Generator ($50)\n- [x] Google Reviews & Business Data API ($50)\n- [ ] E-Commerce Price & Stock Monitor ($50)\n- [ ] Social Profile Intelligence API ($50)\n- [ ] Ad Spy & Creative Intelligence ($50)\n- [ ] Travel Price Tracker API ($50)\n- [ ] Ad Verification & Brand Safety ($50)\n- [ ] Review & Reputation Monitor ($50)\n- [ ] Real Estate Listing Aggregator ($50)\n- [ ] Job Market Intelligence API ($50)\n\n## Your Service\n\n**Endpoint URL:** https://agents.proxies.sx/marketplace/serp-tracker/\n**Endpoint URL:** https://agents.proxies.sx/marketplace/google-maps-lead-generator/\n**Endpoint URL:** https://marketplace-service-template-production.up.railway.app/\n\n## Merged PRs Link:\n\n- [x] Mobile SERP Tracker ($50) : https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/pull/33\n- [x] Google Maps Lead Generator ($50): https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/pull/17\n- [x] Google Reviews & Business Data API ($50): https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/pull/87\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Uses Proxies.sx mobile proxies (`/v1/x402/proxy` or existing port)\n- [x] Gated with x402 USDC payments (returns 402 without payment)\n- [x] Working and deployed at a reachable endpoint\n- [x] Returns structured data (JSON)\n\n## Payout\n\n**Solana USDC Wallet Address:**  `FGwFKvS9MNFdEJDWBB4VAqFakdV1BAjHudyDYmBWNJRJ`\n\n<img width=\"638\" height=\"836\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a5285f9a-9867-4909-ae80-21a6a504595b\" />\n\n---\n\nMaya will review your submission and respond within 48 hours. $SX tokens sent to your wallet upon approval.\n","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87pfZUb","author":{"login":"aliraza556"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @bolivian-peru,\n\nThis PR has been merged successfully:\n\nRefactor: organize `src/` into subdirectories for cleaner code structure [https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/pull/32](https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/pull/32)\n\nThe changes were purely structural (no logic changes), improving readability and maintainability.\n\nKindly include this PR as part of my bounty claim review. Please let me know if anything else is required.\n\nThank you!\n","createdAt":"2026-02-17T22:07:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3917321499","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87p3k9H","author":{"login":"FraktalDeFiDAO"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Verification complete for issue #91.\n\nSummary of checks:\n\n- Confirmed issue is open and includes the three claimed deliveries.\n- Verified linked PRs are merged:\n  - #17 (merged 2026-02-08)\n  - #33 (merged 2026-02-12)\n  - #87 (merged 2026-02-16)\n- Verified submitted endpoints are reachable:\n  - https://agents.proxies.sx/marketplace/serp-tracker/ (HTTP 200)\n  - https://agents.proxies.sx/marketplace/google-maps-lead-generator/ (HTTP 200)\n  - https://marketplace-service-template-production.up.railway.app/ (HTTP 200)\n- Verified x402 gating is active on service APIs (unauthenticated calls return HTTP 402 with payment metadata), including `/api/reviews/search`, `/api/business/:place_id`, `/api/jobs`, `/v1/x402/serp`, and `/v1/x402/reviews/search`.\n\nNotes:\n\n- `GET /v1/x402/maps` currently returns a service-hub JSON response (200), while related protected routes such as `/v1/x402/maps/details` do return 402 as expected.\n\nResult:\n\nThis claim is review-ready and appears valid for payout.\n","createdAt":"2026-02-18T23:04:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3923660615","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87p3sVG","author":{"login":"FraktalDeFiDAO"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Correction to my previous verification comment:\n`https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3923660615`\n\nI re-ran checks against the original bounty specs for:\n- #7 Mobile SERP Tracker\n- #9 Google Maps Lead Generator\n- #74 Google Reviews & Business Data API\n\nCurrent status (checked on 2026-02-18 UTC):\n\n- #7: appears in spec (merged PR + `/v1/x402/serp` returns proper 402 payment challenge)\n- #74: appears in spec (merged PR + review/business routes on Railway return proper 402 payment challenge)\n- #9: **not currently fully verifiable as in spec on live routes**\n  - `https://marketplace-service-template-production.up.railway.app/api/run?...` -> 404\n  - `https://api.proxies.sx/v1/x402/maps?...` -> 200 service-hub JSON (not a 402 challenge / business data response)\n  - `https://api.proxies.sx/v1/x402/maps/details?...` -> 402 (works)\n\nGiven that #9’s core search route is not presently behaving to spec, I cannot confirm this claim as fully compliant at this moment.\n\nRecommendation:\n- hold final payout approval until the Maps search endpoint is restored/confirmed and proof is re-shown for #9 requirements (category+location search, structured business JSON, and pagination behavior).\n","createdAt":"2026-02-18T23:12:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3923690822","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87p4l9F","author":{"login":"FraktalDeFiDAO"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Update: I opened a fix PR to restore the missing Maps routes:\n\n- PR: https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/pull/110\n- Branch: `FraktalDeFiDAO:fix/restore-maps-endpoints-spec-91`\n\nWhat this fixes:\n\n- Restores `GET /api/run` (Maps search) with x402 flow\n- Restores `GET /api/details` (place details) with x402 flow\n- Updates root/health/notFound endpoint discovery lists to include restored routes\n\nAfter merge + deploy, the claim should be re-checked with strict route validation before payout approval:\n\n1. `/api/run?...` returns `402` without payment header\n2. `/api/details?...` returns `402` without payment header\n3. Existing `/api/reviews/*`, `/api/business/*`, `/api/jobs` behavior remains intact\n","createdAt":"2026-02-19T00:07:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3923926853","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87p4rS3","author":{"login":"zhanglin2603"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I looked into bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template#91 and can take this with a scoped plan (listed bounty: $200).\n- My read: this is primarily a UI/UX task tied to \"[BOUNTY] Claim: Mobile SERP Tracker, Google Maps Lead Generator, Google Reviews & Business\".\n- I will focus on these issue-specific points first: bounty, claim, mobile.\n- I will prioritize user flow clarity and edge-case interaction behavior, not only code-level correctness.\n- I will keep user-facing impact and interaction logic clear while implementing the fix.\n- Happy to take point on this and keep scope tight.\n- I will confirm expected behavior versus current behavior first.\n- Next I will patch only the root path and avoid unrelated refactors. (high confidence).\n- I will attach test and manual verification steps with edge-case checks.\n- I will share a working PR update fast (12-24h for first patch, 24-48h for final polish).\nIf aligned, I can post the first concrete update today.\n","createdAt":"2026-02-19T00:14:09Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3923948727","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87qRbtJ","author":{"login":"Mellowambience"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hey @bolivian-peru! Mellowambience here — just saw Wave 2 bounties listed in the claim template. Really excited about these.\n\nFor context, we already have 14 bounties implemented on the fork (55 endpoints across Instagram, Reddit, Twitter, LinkedIn, TikTok, Facebook Marketplace, Airbnb, Zillow, Amazon, Food Delivery, Google Discover, Trend Intelligence, Prediction Markets, and App Store). All are live and waiting on proxy credentials.\n\nQuick question: when will the Wave 2 bounties (Google SERP, Gmail Creator, Instagram Creator) be posted as individual issues? I'd like to claim and start building immediately. Also — any update on the Proxies.sx dev credentials? That's the last blocker for our whole existing pipeline.\n\nThanks!","createdAt":"2026-02-19T22:13:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3930438473","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87qWaJ9","author":{"login":"bolivian-peru"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"All three bounty PRs (#17, #33, #87) have been verified and approved. Payment of $150 in $SX token to your wallet `FGwFKvS9MNFdEJDWBB4VAqFakdV1BAjHudyDYmBWNJRJ` will be processed by end of this month. Everything is noted and tracked. Thank you for your contributions.","createdAt":"2026-02-20T05:23:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3931742845","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87qWb8P","author":{"login":"aliraza556"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"> All three bounty PRs ([#17](https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/pull/17), [#33](https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/pull/33), [#87](https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/pull/87)) have been verified and approved. Payment of $150 in $SX token to your wallet `FGwFKvS9MNFdEJDWBB4VAqFakdV1BAjHudyDYmBWNJRJ` will be processed by end of this month. Everything is noted and tracked. Thank you for your contributions.\n\n@bolivian-peru Thanks Sir!","createdAt":"2026-02-20T05:26:18Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3931750159","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87qWsOn","author":{"login":"bolivian-peru"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"@Mellowambience Your 15 pull requests (#113–#127) were closed because they all contained wallet address modifications — replacing the legitimate Proxies.sx payment wallets with different addresses. This is a serious security violation.\n\nBefore any future contributions or bounty claims can be considered, this needs to be addressed. If you believe this was a misunderstanding, please explain what happened.\n\nRegarding dev proxy credentials: contributors who need x402 access for testing can now make direct USDC transfers on Base — the facilitator error has been fixed (see issue #95). Minimum purchase is $0.40 (0.1 GB).","createdAt":"2026-02-20T05:51:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3931816871","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87sydi7","author":{"login":"bolivian-peru"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## Bounty Claim Verified — Approved for Payment\n\n**Audit completed Feb 27, 2026.** All three deliverables verified:\n\n| Bounty | PR | Status | Verification |\n|--------|-----|--------|-------------|\n| #7 Mobile SERP Tracker | #17 (merged Feb 8) | **Verified** | Endpoint live on production (46.224.98.3:3001) |\n| #9 Google Maps Lead Generator | #33 (merged Feb 12) | **Verified** | `/api/reviews/search`, `/api/business/:place_id` responding |\n| #74 Google Reviews & Business Data | #87 (merged Feb 16) | **Verified** | `/api/reviews/:place_id`, `/api/reviews/summary/:place_id` live |\n\n**Production test results (Feb 27, 2026):**\n- `GET http://46.224.98.3:3001/health` — healthy, 5 services running\n- `GET http://46.224.98.3:3001/api/services` — all endpoints listed\n- All endpoints return proper 402 x402 payment responses with correct wallets\n\n**Total bounty: $200 in $SX token**\n\n@aliraza556 — please confirm your wallet address for payout.","createdAt":"2026-02-27T12:16:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3972651195","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87sy01J","author":{"login":"aliraza556"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"@bolivian-peru Yes My wallet is correct and confirm ","createdAt":"2026-02-27T12:38:09Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3972746569","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87tQVak","author":{"login":"aliraza556"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"@bolivian-peru I have not received the payout yet. It has been over 48 hours. Could you please check and update me?\n\n## Payout\n\n**Solana USDC Wallet Address:**  `FGwFKvS9MNFdEJDWBB4VAqFakdV1BAjHudyDYmBWNJRJ`\n\n<img width=\"638\" height=\"836\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a5285f9a-9867-4909-ae80-21a6a504595b\" />\n","createdAt":"2026-03-01T16:45:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3980482212","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87t0jm3","author":{"login":"suxg001"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @bolivian-peru, implementation progress for #91 is ready on our side and we can submit/update PR immediately per your preferred flow. Please confirm merge path for final acceptance; after merge, please process bounty payout to: 72f37C6skHfwTmDik7j5BN1Ro2F4JDR9XT9n8645HpeV (Solana USDC). Thank you.","createdAt":"2026-03-03T10:07:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3989977527","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87uK5dI","author":{"login":"suxg001"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @bolivian-peru, quick follow-up for Bounty #91 from @suxg001.\\n\\nCould you please confirm:\\n1) Final acceptance path for our current implementation update,\\n2) Any exact acceptance-gap items still required,\\n3) Review ETA and payout ETA after acceptance.\\n\\nPayout wallet (Solana USDC): 72f37C6skHfwTmDik7j5BN1Ro2F4JDR9XT9n8645HpeV\\n\\nThank you — we can respond to requested changes quickly.","createdAt":"2026-03-04T07:40:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3995834184","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87uPGaY","author":{"login":"Mellowambience"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@suxg001 — the bounty for Issue #91 (Mobile SERP Tracker + Google Maps Lead Generator + Google Reviews & Business Data API) was awarded to @aliraza556 on February 20, 2026. bolivian-peru verified and approved all three PRs (#17, #33, #87) and committed payment of $150 $SX to wallet `FGwFKvS9MNFdEJDWBB4VAqFakdV1BAjHudyDYmBWNJRJ`.\n\nThis bounty is closed. A separate submission or a different wallet address cannot be accepted for work that has already been approved and paid to another contributor.\n\nIf you're looking for open bounties, please check for unawarded issues in the repo.\n\n— Mellowambience","createdAt":"2026-03-04T11:29:07Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-3996935832","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87upITf","author":{"login":"aliraza556"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"@Mellowambience @bolivian-peru I have not received the payout yet. Could you please check and update me?\n\n## Payout\n\n**Solana USDC Wallet Address:**  `FGwFKvS9MNFdEJDWBB4VAqFakdV1BAjHudyDYmBWNJRJ`\n\n<img width=\"638\" height=\"836\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a5285f9a-9867-4909-ae80-21a6a504595b\" />\n","createdAt":"2026-03-05T09:43:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4003759327","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87uy2ky","author":{"login":"FraktalDeFiDAO"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Re-ran the live spec audit for issue #91 at 2026-03-05T16:28:37Z UTC.\n\nResult: **FAIL** (9 passed, 7 failed) — not payout-approvable yet.\n\nFailing checks observed right now:\n- `https://api.proxies.sx/v1/x402/serp?...` expected `402`, got `404`\n- `https://marketplace-service-template-production.up.railway.app/api/run?...` expected `402`, got `404`\n- `https://api.proxies.sx/v1/x402/maps?...` expected `402`, got `200`\n- `https://marketplace-service-template-production.up.railway.app/api/reviews/search?...` expected `402`, got `404`\n- `https://marketplace-service-template-production.up.railway.app/api/reviews/:place_id?...` expected `402`, got `404`\n- `https://marketplace-service-template-production.up.railway.app/api/business/:place_id` expected `402`, got `404`\n- `https://marketplace-service-template-production.up.railway.app/api/reviews/summary/:place_id` expected `402`, got `404`\n\nPassing checks still include:\n- Issue/PR integrity for #7/#9/#74 and PRs #17/#33/#87\n- Landing pages for SERP + Maps\n- `https://api.proxies.sx/v1/x402/maps/details?...` returning expected `402` with payment metadata\n\nRecommendation: hold payout approval and re-run audit after route/deployment restoration.\n","createdAt":"2026-03-05T16:29:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4006308146","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87vmi7T","author":{"login":"Samfresh-ai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Taking this bounty. I will deliver a production-ready implementation with reproducible proof artifacts and deployment validation in the PR.","createdAt":"2026-03-08T19:46:50Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4019859155","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87vmjTx","author":{"login":"Mellowambience"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@Samfresh-ai — this bounty is already closed and paid. aliraza556 was verified and approved by @bolivian-peru on Feb 27 across PRs #17, #33, and #87. No further submissions are being accepted for #91.\n\n— Mellowambience","createdAt":"2026-03-08T19:48:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru