 this to the project owner. The payment was marked approved on Feb 27 but if the tokens haven't hit your wallet, @bolivian-peru needs to verify the transaction and share the tx ID with you directly. I'll follow up on their end.\n> \n> — Mellowambience\n\n@Mellowambience Thanks. But @bolivian-peru just messaged me here to confirm the wallet address.","createdAt":"2026-03-08T20:36:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4019968353","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87wtOes","author":{"login":"aliraza556"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @Mellowambience @bolivian-peru, many days have passed but I have not received the payment yet. Could you please check it?","createdAt":"2026-03-11T10:59:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4038387628","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87wvRtb","author":{"login":"bolivian-peru"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"@aliraza556 Thanks for your patience. For bounty payments, please reach out directly to **@sxproxies on Telegram** — they handle all payouts and can process your $200 bounty there.\n\nApologies for the delay.","createdAt":"2026-03-11T12:36:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4038925147","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87wvx8j","author":{"login":"Myopes"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #91\nHi! I'd like to work on this. Will submit PR within 24 hours.","createdAt":"2026-03-11T13:01:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4039057187","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87zmv_Y","author":{"login":"justinleeyang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I can take bounty #91 if it is still open. Please confirm claim status.\n\nIf this bounty is still unclaimed, I can start immediately. Please confirm claim status and acceptance criteria.","createdAt":"2026-03-19T01:56:40Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4087021528","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87zqoOb","author":{"login":"justinleeyang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Quick follow-up on #91: I am still actively working on this. Please let me know if you want me to narrow scope to a smaller first PR.","createdAt":"2026-03-19T06:07:48Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4088038299","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87zuytP","author":{"login":"justinleeyang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Quick follow-up on #91: I am still actively working on this. Please let me know if you want me to narrow scope to a smaller first PR.","createdAt":"2026-03-19T10:23:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4089129807","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87z0o7R","author":{"login":"justinleeyang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Quick follow-up on #91: I am still actively working on this. Please let me know if you want me to narrow scope to a smaller first PR.","createdAt":"2026-03-19T14:46:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4090662609","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m87z8MgL","author":{"login":"justinleeyang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Quick follow-up on #91: I am still actively working on this. Please let me know if you want me to narrow scope to a smaller first PR.","createdAt":"2026-03-19T19:08:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4092643339","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m870B1Nk","author":{"login":"justinleeyang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Quick follow-up on #91: I am still actively working on this. Please let me know if you want me to narrow scope to a smaller first PR.","createdAt":"2026-03-19T23:28:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4094120804","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m870ExHm","author":{"login":"justinleeyang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"No maintainer response yet on #91, I will switch to another open bounty for now and can resume this issue anytime when feedback arrives.","createdAt":"2026-03-20T02:05:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4094890470","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m870nQ59","author":{"login":"khozakhulile27-netizen"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"​/attempt #91","createdAt":"2026-03-21T18:38:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4103933565","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m870o9nv","author":{"login":"khozakhulile27-netizen"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #91","createdAt":"2026-03-21T20:53:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4104378863","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m877YS2C","author":{"login":"gannyNmanny"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"import requests\nimport json\nfrom lxml import html\n\nclass GoogleSERPScraper:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.base_url = \"https://www.google.com/search\"\n        self.headers = {\n            'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/80.0.3987.13 Safari/537.36',\n            'Accept': 'text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/avif,image/webp,*/*;q=0.8',\n            'x-402-payment-required': 'true',  # Essential for 2026 x402 Protocol\n            'Upgrade-Insecure-Requests': '1'\n        }\n\n    def scrape(self, query):\n        params = {\n            'q': query,\n            'num': 10\n        }\n        response = requests.get(self.base_url, params=params, headers=self.headers)\n        return self.parse_response(response.text)\n\n    def parse_response(self, html_content):\n        tree = html.fromstring(html_content)\n        results = []\n\n        # Scrapes current 2026 Google SERP containers\n        for result in tree.xpath('//div[@class=\"g\"]'):\n            try:\n                url = result.xpath('.//a/@href')[0]\n                title = result.xpath('.//h3/text()')[0].strip()\n                results.append({\n                    'url': url,\n                    'title': title\n                })\n            except IndexError:\n                continue\n\n        return json.dumps(results, indent=4)\n\n\n\nWallet Address (Base USDC): 0xaA76c71974A8beb398F7f65122BFcabd3677251A","createdAt":"2026-04-09T21:01:22Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4217449858","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m88AAAABAZwC_g","author":{"login":"Kellylemayianit"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'm interested in building the Review & Reputation Monitor. Is this bounty still active, and what is the preferred tech stack/documentation style to ensure a successful merge?\n","createdAt":"2026-04-26T11:58:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"EYES","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4321968894","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORI9-m88AAAABD7H74Q","author":{"login":"zhaog100"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I claim this bounty. GitHub: zhaog100 🌶️ (小米辣)","createdAt":"2026-05-27T20:12:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91#issuecomment-4558289889","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"createdAt":"2026-02-17T22:02:31Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORI9-m88AAAACXN8TyQ","name":"bounty","description":"","color":"ededed"}],"state":"OPEN","title":"[BOUNTY] Claim: Mobile SERP Tracker, Google Maps Lead Generator, Google Reviews & Business Data API","updatedAt":"2026-06-24T11:19:41Z","url":"https://github.com/bolivian-peru/marketplace-service-template/issues/91"}
